  "worked_solution": "Suppose $u$ and $v$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $u\\times v=0$ if and only if $u\u2225v.$\n\nSince the angle between $u$ and $v$ is ${0}^{\u2218},$ our vectors must be parallel. \n\nTherefore, $u\\times v=0.$",
